trigger1 = time = 0
value = SCA,NA,SA,HA
time = 1

[State 10000];解除
type = VarSet
triggerall = var(29) = 1
trigger1 = time = 1
var(29) = 0

[State 16010]
type = pause;画面上の全てのスプライト、キャラクター、背景を止める
